	('betanews', 'de', 'messages', '<b>Herzlich Willkommen bei BeWelcome BETA!</b>\r\nEntdecke die Möglichkeiten und hilf uns dieses ehrgeizige Projekt zu realisieren. Wie? Berichte uns von Problemen und lass uns wissen was wir verbessern können. Vielen Dank!\r\n\r\n<b>Beta news (only in English)</b>\r\n\r\n28/2/2007: Currently there are problems with Internet Explorer (<b>Firefox</b> works better)\r\n\r\n24/2/2007: a new Index page is online! Check it!\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: a new preference advanced features allow you to use, well advanced features, more to come about it ...\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: This night server was down, Hannu who restore it is inquiring about the reason\r\n\r\n19/2/2007: the comments options are currently being changed, according to what was decided in last crowd meeting. Some disturbances are to be expected with comments todays\r\n\r\n16/2/2007: The accomodation option (May be/No/Yes) have been update according to what was defined during the Crowd Skype meeting on Thursday Feb 15th. Check your profile !', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 91),
	('betanews', 'en', 'messages', '<b>Welcome to BeWelcome BETA!</b>\r\nDiscover it and help us to build this ambitious project. How? Give us feedback about problems you find and what you like  or not. \r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n<b>Beta news</b>\r\n\r\n17/4/2007 : based on maurizio initial work, I just introduce some pagination for members page. The number of member is 10 per page, the page link is a bit ugly with the number of sub-pages, it will be improved later (jeanyves)\r\n\r\n7/4/2007 : if you are interested in BeVolunteers (the organization in charge of BeWelcome), there is some information <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/index.php/Main_Page">here</a> and a future General Assembly in Brussels by May 5\r\n\r\n4/4/2007 : Geodatabase get more stable. Still some region are missing but all cities should be available.\r\n\r\n10/3/2007 : Translated profiles appears with corresponding Flag on each member page.\r\nThe tool for allowing other (trusted) members to translate your profile will be soon ready.\r\n\r\n6/3/2007 : several things :\r\n- one quite important for your profile, Felipe (<a href="member.php?cid=feto">feto</a>) introduced mother language which was missing in the language choice,\r\n- in <a href="mymessages.php">mymessages</a> the <b>del</b> link works now and the <b>Reply link</b> remove the Not Read Flag\r\n- some of the IE bugs have been solve (not everything yet)\r\n\r\n28/2/2007: Currently there are problems with Internet Explorer (<b>Firefox</b> works better)\r\n\r\n24/2/2007: a new Index page is online! Check it!\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: a new preference advanced features allow you to use, well advanced features, more to come about it ...\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: This night server was down, Hannu who restore it is inquiring about the reason\r\n\r\n19/2/2007: the comments options are currently being changed, according to what was decided in last crowd meeting. Some disturbances are to be expected with comments todays\r\n\r\n16/2/2007: The accommodation option (May be/No/Yes) have been update according to what was defined during the Crowd Skype meeting on Thursday Feb 15th. Check your profile!', '2008-03-29 16:01:12', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '2009-02-15 17:29:33', 'yes', 'This is the BetaNews used by programmers or volunteers to put a quick message on main page while we are on beta phase\r\n\r\nNo need to translate it !', 10, 1, 97),
	('betanews', 'lt', 'messages', '<b>Sveiki atvykę į BeWelcome BETA!</b>\r\nSusipažinkite su šiuo ambicingu projektu bei prisidėkite prie jo kūrimo. Kaip? Parašykite mums apie sunkumus bei keblumus, su kuriais galbūt susidūrėte naudodamiesi šiuo tinklapiu arba parašykite, kas jums patiko, o kas ne. Dėkui!\r\n\r\n<b>Beta naujienos</b>\r\n\r\n17/4/2007 : based on maurizio initial work, I just introduce some pagination for members page. The number of member is 10 per page, the page link is a bit ugly with the number of sub-pages, it will be impoved later (jeanyves)\r\n\r\n7/4/2007 : if you are intersted in BeVolunteers (the organization in charge of BeWelcome), there is some information <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/index.php/Main_Page">here</a> and a future General Assembly in Brussel by May 5\r\n\r\n4/4/2007 : Geodatabase get more stable. Still some region are missing but all cities should be available. \r\n\r\n10/3/2007 : Translated profiles appears with corresponding Flag on each member page. The tool for allowing other (trusted) members to translate your profile will be soon ready. \r\n6/3/2007 : several things : \r\n- one quite important for your profile, Felipe (<a href="member.php?cid=feto">feto</a>) introduced mother language which was missing in the language choice, \r\n- in <a href="mymessages.php">mymessages</a> the <b>del</b> link works now and the <b>Reply link</b> remove the Not Read Flag \r\n- some of the IE bugs have been solve (not everything yet) \r\n\r\n28/2/2007: Currently there are problems with Internet Explorer (<b>Firefox</b> works better)\r\n\r\n24/2/2007: a new Index page is online! Check it!\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: a new preference advanced features allow you to use, well advanced features, more to come about it ...\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: This night server was down, Hannu who restore it is inquiring about the reason\r\n\r\n19/2/2007: the comments options are currently being changed, according to what was decided in last crowd meeting. Some disturbances are to be expected with comments todays\r\n\r\n16/2/2007: The accomodation option (May be/No/Yes) have been update according to what was defined during the Crowd Skype meeting on Thursday Feb 15th. Check your profile !', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 80),
	('betanews', 'nl', 'messages', '<b>Welkom op BeWelcome BETA!</b> \r\nOntdek onze website en help ons dit ambitieus project waar te maken. Hoe? Geef ons feedback over mogelijke problemen en vertel ons wat je graag wil of niet. \r\nDank je! \r\n\r\n<b>Beta nieuws</b> \r\n\r\n28/2/2007: Currently there are problems with Internet Explorer (<b>Firefox</b> works better) \r\n\r\n24/2/2007: a new Index page is online! Check it! \r\n\r\n21/2/2007: a new preference advanced features allow you to use, well advanced features, more to come about it ... \r\n\r\n21/2/2007: This night server was down, Hannu who restore it is inquiring about the reason \r\n\r\n19/2/2007: the comments options are currently being changed, according to what was decided in last crowd meeting. Some disturbances are to be expected with comments todays \r\n\r\n16/2/2007: The accomodation option (May be/No/Yes) have been update according to what was defined during the Crowd Skype meeting on Thursday Feb 15th. Check your profile!', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 97),
	('betanews', 'ru', 'messages', '<b>Welcome to BeWelcome BETA!</b>\r\nDiscover it and help us to build this ambitious project. How? Give us feedback about problems you find and what you like or not.\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n<b>Beta news</b>\r\n\r\n17/4/2007 : based on maurizio initial work, I just introduce some pagination for members page. The number of member is 10 per page, the page link is a bit ugly with the number of sub-pages, it will be impoved later (jeanyves)\r\n\r\n7/4/2007 : if you are intersted in BeVolunteers (the organization in charge of BeWelcome), there is some information <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/index.php/Main_Page">here</a> and a future General Assembly in Brussel by May 5\r\n\r\n4/4/2007 : Geodatabase get more stable. Still some region are missing but all cities should be available.\r\n\r\n10/3/2007 : Translated profiles appears with corresponding Flag on each member page.\r\nThe tool for allowing other (trusted) members to translate your profile will be soon ready.\r\n\r\n6/3/2007 : several things :\r\n- one quite important for your profile, Felipe (<a href="member.php?cid=feto">feto</a>) introduced mother language which was missing in the language choice,\r\n- in <a href="mymessages.php">mymessages</a> the <b>del</b> link works now and the <b>Reply link</b> remove the Not Read Flag\r\n- some of the IE bugs have been solve (not everything yet)\r\n\r\n28/2/2007: Currently there are problems with Internet Explorer (<b>Firefox</b> works better)\r\n\r\n24/2/2007: a new Index page is online! Check it!\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: a new preference advanced features allow you to use, well advanced features, more to come about it ...\r\n\r\n21/2/2007: This night server was down, Hannu who restore it is inquiring about the reason\r\n\r\n19/2/2007: the comments options are currently being changed, according to what was decided in last crowd meeting. Some disturbances are to be expected with comments todays\r\n\r\n16/2/2007: The accomodation option (May be/No/Yes) have been update according to what was defined during the Crowd Skype meeting on Thursday Feb 15th. Check your profile !', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 79),
