	('findpeopletypicoffertip', 'zh-hans', 'messages', '与 “和” 结合', '2016-01-26 19:01:47', '2021-05-02 07:48:47', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, NULL, 37722),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'ca', 'messages', 'Deixa-ho en blanc o escriu-hi <b>man*</b> si només vols seleccionar <b>mandurria</b>, <b>manel</b>, etc. Si hi escrius <b>*man*</b>, també s\'inclouran paraules com <b>amanda</b>, <b>ultraman</b>, etc.', '2007-08-30 22:43:04', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 177),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'de', 'messages', 'Du kannst dieses Feld freilassen oder z.B. <b>pet*</b> eintragen, wenn du alle Wörter, die mit "pet" anfangen, finden möchtest (<b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, etc).  \r\nGenauso kannst du <b>*pet*</b> eintragen, dann wird jedes Wort angezeigt, das "pet" enthält, also zusätzlich zu <i>petula</i> und <i>peter</i> auch <b>carpet</b>.', '2007-07-01 10:09:25', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 91),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'en', 'messages', 'Leave blank or fill with <b>pet*</b> if you want to select only <b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, etc ..\r\nfill with <b>*pet*</b> in addition to <i>petula</i> and <i>peter</i>, will also find <b>carpet</b>', '2007-06-10 11:13:37', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '2008-04-13 16:16:26', 'no', 'This is the explanation of the Username criteria in the FIndPeople page', 5, 1, 1),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'es', 'messages', 'Deja en blanco o rellena con <b>pet*</b> si deseas seleccionar sólo <b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, etc.. rellena con <b>*pet*</b> en adición a <i>petula</i> y <i>peter</i>, también encontrará <b>carpet</b>', '2008-01-09 19:09:36', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 1328),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'fr', 'messages', 'Laissez blanc ou remplissez avec <b>pier*</b> si vous voulez retrouver <b>pierre</b>, <b>pierrot</b>, etc ..\r\nRemplissez avec  <b>*pier*</b> et vous trouverez <b>jean-pierre</b> en plus de <i>pierre</i>', '2007-06-27 08:19:03', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 68),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'it', 'messages', 'Lascia vuoto o inserisci <b>pet*</b> se vuoi selezionare solo <b>petula ,petersamson</b> , ecc.\r\nInserisci <b>*pet*</b> se, oltre a <i>petula e peter</i> , vuoi <b>carpet</b>\r\n', '2007-06-29 12:28:22', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 103),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'lt', 'messages', 'Palikite tuščią, arba įveskite <b>mar*</b>, jei jums reikia surasti <b>marius</b>, <b>marina</b>, ir pan.; arba įveskite <b>*mar*</b> ir rasite ne tik <b>marius</b> ir pan., bei ir <b>tamara</b>, ir t.t.', '2007-08-31 13:14:55', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 227),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'lv', 'messages', 'Atstāj neaizpildītu vai ieraksti <b>pet*</b> ja tu vēlies izvēlēties tikai <b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, utt ..\r\nieraksti <b>*pet*</b> papildus <i>petula</i> un <i>peter</i>, tiks arī atrasts <b>carpet</b>', '2007-09-03 10:20:30', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 375),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'nl', 'messages', 'Laat dit leeg of vul aan met bijvoorbeeld <b>pet*</b> indien u alleen <b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, enz. wil vinden. \r\nVul <b>*pet*</b> in als u naast <i>petula</i> en <i>peter</i> ook <b>carpet</b> wil vinden. ', '2007-09-04 13:25:07', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 69),
	('findpeopleusernameexp', 'pt', 'messages', 'Deixe em branco ou escreva <b>pet*</b> se pretender encontrar <b>petula</b>, <b>petersamson</b>, etc...\r\nPreenchendo com <b>*pet*</b>, para além de <i>petula</i> e <i>peter</i> irá também encontrar <b>carpet</b>', '2013-01-14 11:58:24', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 38787),
	('firstloginfirst', 'en', 'messages', 'Welcome %s, as it is the first time you login please fill out your profile.', '2015-01-29 12:45:43', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', 'Flash notice shown on first login', 5, 1, 1),
	('firstloginfirst', 'it', 'messages', 'Benvenuto %1$s! E\' la prima volta che fai il login: per favore, riempi il tuo profilo.', '2015-02-06 19:44:18', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 14616),
	('firstloginfirst', 'pt', 'messages', 'Bem-vindo/a %s, como é a primeira vez que acede ao site, por favor, preencha o seu perfil.', '2015-01-29 13:35:44', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 38787),
	('firstloginfirst', 'sr', 'messages', 'Добродошао %s, пошто ти је ово први пут да си се пријавио, молимо да попуниш свој профил.', '2015-01-30 10:40:59', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'yes', '', 5, 1, 39772),
