	('indexpageword8', 'bg', 'messages', 'Подробна информация относно BeVolunteer  може да бъде намерена на <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>. \r\nМожеш също <a href="feedback.php">да ни пишеш</a>.', '2007-07-05 23:33:42', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 851),
	('indexpageword8', 'ca', 'messages', 'Llegeix sobre <a href="mission.php">la missió i els objectius de BeWelcome</a>.\r\nPots trobar tota la informació relacionada amb BeVolunteer a <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nTambé pots <a href="feedback.php">contactar amb nosaltres</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 177),
	('indexpageword8', 'da', 'messages', 'Al relevant information om BeVolunteer kan findes på <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nDu kan også <a href="feedback.php">kontakte os</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 74),
	('indexpageword8', 'de', 'messages', 'Lese mehr über <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">die Mission und die Ziele von BeVolunteer</a>. Weitere Informationen zu BeVolunteer gibt es unter <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>\r\n\r\nWenn du möchtest, kannst du uns auch gerne <a href="feedback.php">kontaktieren</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 3050),
	('indexpageword8', 'en', 'messages', 'Read more about <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">the BeVolunteer mission and objectives</a>. More information related to BeVolunteer can be found at <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nAlso, feel free to <a href="feedback.php">contact us</a>.', '2008-01-07 12:41:14', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '2008-04-13 16:16:26', 'no', '', 5, 1, 71),
	('indexpageword8', 'eo', 'messages', 'Legu pli pri <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">la misio kaj celo de BeVolunteer</a>. Plia informo pri BeVolunteer on povas trovi ĉe <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nAnkaŭ bonvolu senhezite <a href="feedback.php">kontaktu nin</a> ial ajn. ', '2007-09-11 17:36:07', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 1769),
	('indexpageword8', 'es', 'messages', 'Lee más sobre <a href="mission.php">objetivos y misiones de BeWelcome</a>. Más información sobre BeVolunteer puedes encontrarla en <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>. \r\n\r\n¡También puedes <a href="feedback.php">contactarnos</a>!', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 1328),
	('indexpageword8', 'fi', 'messages', 'Kaikki BeVolunteeriin liittyvä tieto löytyy osoitteesta <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nVoit myös <a href="feedback.php">ottaa yhteyttä</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 72),
	('indexpageword8', 'fr', 'messages', 'Vous pouvez en lire plus concernant <a href="mission.php">les missions et objectifs de BeWelcome</a>.Toutes les informations concernant le projet de promotion de l\'échange d\'hospitalité de BeVolunteer peuvent être trouvées sur <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>. \r\n\r\nAussi, n\'hésitez pas à <a href="feedback.php">nous contacter</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 452),
	('indexpageword8', 'hr', 'messages', 'Pročitaj više o <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">misija i ciljevi BeVolunteer-a mission</a>. Više informacija vezanih za BeVolunteer pronaći ćeš na <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>. \r\n\r\nI naravno, slobodno nas <a href="feedback.php">kontaktiraj</a>. ', '2009-09-23 16:46:50', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 8197),
	('indexpageword8', 'id', 'messages', 'Baca lebih lanjut <a href="mission.php">visi dan misi BeWelcome </a>.\r\nSemua informasi yang berhubungan dengan BeVolunteer juga dapat dilihat di <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>', '2007-11-05 18:32:44', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 2019),
	('indexpageword8', 'it', 'messages', 'Leggi riguardo alla <a href="mission.php"> missione di BeWelcome e ai suoi obbiettivi</a>.\r\nTutte le informazioni relative a Bevolunteer possono essere trovate su <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\nSei inoltre libero di <a href="feedback.php">contattarci</a>.\r\n', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 103),
	('indexpageword8', 'lt', 'messages', 'Skaitykite daugiau apie <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">BeWelcome misiją bei tikslus</a>.\r\nVisą informaciją apie BeVolunteer galite rasti čia: <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nJei pageidaujate, galite visada <a href="feedback.php">susisiekti</a> su mumis.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 227),
	('indexpageword8', 'lv', 'messages', 'Izlasi vairāk par <a href="mission.php">BeWelcome misija un mērķi</a>. \r\nVisu informāciju saistībā ar BeVolunteer var atrast <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nTu vari arī <a href="feedback.php">Sazinies ar mums</a>.', '2007-09-03 10:24:44', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 375),
	('indexpageword8', 'nl', 'messages', 'Alle informatie met betrekking tot BeVolunteer kan gevonden worden op <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nJe kunt ons ook <a href="feedback.php">een bericht sturen</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 138),
	('indexpageword8', 'pl', 'messages', 'Wszystkie informacje związane z BeVolunteer znajdziesz tu <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 213),
	('indexpageword8', 'pt', 'messages', 'Todas as informações relacionadas com BeVolunteer podem ser encontradas em <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nPode também <a href="feedback.php">contactar-nos</a>.', '2007-07-17 22:55:48', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 752),
	('indexpageword8', 'pt-BR', 'messages', 'Leia mais sobre a <a href="mission.php"> missão e os objetivos do BeWelcome</a>. \r\nTodas as informações relacionadas ao BeVolunteer podem ser encontradas em <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org"> www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nVocê também pode <a href="feedback.php">falar conosco</a>.', '2007-08-07 13:52:15', '2021-05-02 07:49:01', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 144),
	('indexpageword8', 'ru', 'messages', 'Познакомьтесь с <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org/wiki/Our_mission_and_objectives">Целями и задачами BeVolunteer</a>. Подробную информацию о BeVolunteer можно найти на <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a>.\r\n\r\nМы можете также <a href="feedback.php">связаться с нами</a>.', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 79),
	('indexpageword8', 'tr', 'messages', 'BeVolunteer ile ilgili tüm bilgilere <a href="http://www.bevolunteer.org">www.BeVolunteer.org</a> sayfasından ulaşabilirsiniz. ', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2019-04-23 18:16:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 'no', '', 5, 1, 140),
